<section class="band-navy" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 id="how-title">Five steps from scope to fix</h2>
      <p>Bluebird uses AI to rapidly assess your websites and digital services, then works with you on what it finds.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="flow" style="--n:5">
      <li><h3>Agree the scope</h3><p>We agree which websites and digital services the assessment covers.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Discover what is public</h3><p>The assessment looks at what is publicly reachable, such as published pages and documents, the way an AI agent would.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Assess each finding</h3><p>Each finding is assessed as a risk, a vulnerability or an unintended exposure.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Score and rank</h3><p>The assessment produces an overall risk score and ranks findings High, Medium or Low.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Fix and follow through</h3><p>You receive guidance to fix every finding, and Bluebird helps you address the issues.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="boundary">
      <div>
        <h3>What the AI does</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Rapidly finds and reads what is publicly reachable across your sites and documents.</li>
          <li>Spots risks, vulnerabilities and unintended exposure the way an AI agent would.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="never">
        <h3>What stays with people</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Scope:</strong> you and Bluebird agree what is assessed.</li>
          <li><strong>Priorities:</strong> your team decides what to fix first, using the ranking and fix guidance.</li>
          <li><strong>Remediation:</strong> Bluebird's security-cleared team helps you address the issues.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

